2
00:01:09,000 --> 00:03:02,000
[Title: ホロライブ4期生 5周年記念！]
[Title: Hololive 4th Generation 5th Anniversary!]

3
00:03:14,750 --> 00:03:19,300
うーまるっ！うーまるっ！うまじゃないよ うーまるっ！
Umar! Umar! It's not a horse, it's Umar!

4
00:03:22,050 --> 00:03:25,200
だってだってシンデレラ お遊び倒せ
Be a Cinderella and play the day away!

5
00:03:25,500 --> 00:03:29,000
もっと もっと 楽しめよオトメ
Have even more fun, oh maiden!

6
00:03:29,300 --> 00:03:32,200
みんなに気づかれないように
So that nobody notices you...

7
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:37,500
いざゆけ 秘密のパラダイス
Off we go to our secret paradise!

8
00:03:41,100 --> 00:03:44,000
お気に入りのフードかぶり
With my favorite hoodie on...

9
00:03:44,100 --> 00:03:47,500
今日も今日とてゴロゴロして
Lazing around today as usual,

10
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:51,000
大好物のポテチを手に
With my favorite potato chips in hand,

11
00:03:51,100 --> 00:03:54,500
パソコンとにらめっこしよ
Staring down the computer screen.

12
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:58,000
立ったまま3秒で 眠れる魔法
The magic to fall asleep standing in three seconds.

13
00:03:58,500 --> 00:04:01,500
歩く姿は百合の花
Walking like a lily flower,

14
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:05,000
誰もが羨む 完璧JK
The flawless high school girl everyone envies!

15
00:04:05,100 --> 00:04:08,500
ほら計画狂ったら必死んださ 探せ足跡
Look, if the plan falls apart, search desperately for footprints!

16
00:04:08,900 --> 00:04:12,500
いつでもくれるおやつのサレコウベ
Always giving snacks like a skull-bearer...

17
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:19,000
ずっと ずっと ゲームはともだち
Always, always, games are my friends.

18
00:04:19,500 --> 00:04:22,500
おにいにゃんはきびしいけど
Big brother can be strict, but...

19
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:27,000
ひとりにしないでちょうだい
Please don't leave me all alone!

20
00:04:27,300 --> 00:04:31,500
我儘おんなじ 大好きの裏返し
Such selfishness is just the flip side of love!

21
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:37,000
うーまるっ！うーまるっ！うまじゃないよ うーまるっ！
Umar! Umar! It's not a horse, it's Umar!

22
00:04:39,100 --> 00:04:41,800
外では 猫かぶり
Putting on a sweet face outside,

23
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:44,800
今日も明日も演じるのです
Playing the part today and tomorrow.

24
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:47,800
大好物の 笑顔ぶきに
Using my favorite smiles as a weapon,

25
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:51,200
友達に笑えないように
So I won't lose my smile to friends...

26
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:55,000
立ったまま２秒で 座ればマナー
Sitting down in two seconds flat is good manners.

27
00:04:55,200 --> 00:04:59,500
歩く姿はチンチクリリン
Walking like a tiny little thing.

28
00:05:00,008 --> 00:05:02,358
もっといじわる愛してよ さあ限界超えるまる・ぱ・り・い・だ！
Love me even more teasingly! Come on, it's a limit-breaking round party-da!

29
00:05:03,458 --> 00:05:06,858
歌えーっ！はじまりだー！
Sing! It's starting!

30
00:05:10,008 --> 00:05:13,458
いろんなこえがまざりあって
Various voices blend together,

31
00:05:26,558 --> 00:05:30,208
枯れるほど鳴くな女の子
Don't cry until you're hoarse, girls!

32
00:05:30,958 --> 00:05:37,458
演じてみてもお兄ちゃんだけは甘えられない
Even if I act like it, I can't rely on you alone, big bro!

33
00:05:37,808 --> 00:05:43,058
嫌われたくないもん 素直に言えないありがとう
I don't want to be disliked, so I can't honestly say "thank you."

34
00:05:45,008 --> 00:05:47,358
態度で示そう
Let's show it through our actions!

35
00:05:48,058 --> 00:05:54,408
さあ！点検してかい？もういいじゃん お兄ちゃんなんて知らない
Come on! Have you checked? That's enough, I don't care about big bro at all!

36
00:05:55,708 --> 00:05:57,208
なんつって
Just kidding!

37
00:06:00,258 --> 00:06:07,458
一心同体 二人にひとつだけ だってだって それが兄弟でしょ 一蓮托生 二人きりの 運命共同体
Body and soul as one, just one between the two of us! Because, because, that's what siblings are! Sharing the same fate, just the two of us, bound by destiny!

38
00:06:09,908 --> 00:06:13,208
今日だって地球の本拠地は笑い飛ばせ
Today too, laugh away the stronghold of Earth!

39
00:06:13,458 --> 00:06:19,458
もっともっと楽しんだもんがち 天真爛漫スマイルで ぎゅっとずっと心を掴んじゃうの
More and more, those who have fun win! With an innocent smile, grabbing your heart tightly!

40
00:06:21,058 --> 00:06:26,458
やりたい放題は 信頼の裏返し
Doing whatever you want is a sign of trust!

41
00:06:29,858 --> 00:06:36,458
うまるーん！ゆーえむおー！ うまるーん！ゆーえむおー！ yeah!
Umarn! U.M.R.! Umarn! U.M.R.! Yeah!

42
00:06:36,858 --> 00:06:41,258
ハイ、おしまいっ！
And that's the end!

43
00:06:52,208 --> 00:06:59,858
止まらない未来を目指して
Aiming for an unstoppable future,

44
00:07:01,858 --> 00:07:08,858
譲れない願いを抱きしめて
Embracing an unwavering wish,

45
00:07:16,858 --> 00:07:20,158
[Text: ゆずれない願い]
[Text: Yuzurenai Negai]

46
00:07:23,258 --> 00:07:28,958
髪の色が赤く染まってゆく無重力状態
My hair is dyed a deep red in this zero-gravity state,

47
00:07:29,958 --> 00:07:35,358
このまま風にさらわれたい
I want to be swept away by the wind just like this.

48
00:07:36,158 --> 00:07:44,358
いつも飛び越えないハードルを負けない気持ちでクリアしてきたけど
Always clearing hurdles I could never jump over with an unbeatable spirit, but...

49
00:07:44,958 --> 00:07:50,008
出し切れない実力は誰のせい？
Whose fault is it that I can't show my full strength?

50
00:07:53,308 --> 00:08:00,158
止まらない未来を目指して
Aiming for an unstoppable future,

51
00:08:00,658 --> 00:08:06,858
譲れない願いを抱きしめて
Embracing an unwavering wish,

52
00:08:07,158 --> 00:08:14,508
色褪せない心の地図 光にかざそう
Holding up the unfading map of my heart to the light!

53
00:08:20,508 --> 00:08:25,208
どれだけ泣けば朝に巡り逢えるの
How much must I cry before I can meet the morning?

54
00:08:27,258 --> 00:08:32,408
孤独な夜はじめて限界を感じた日
On a lonely night, the first day I felt my limit...

55
00:08:33,808 --> 00:08:41,258
きっと恋に落ちるのは守るみたいないっしょの情熱だけど
Surely falling in love is like a shared passion to protect, but...

56
00:08:43,058 --> 00:08:48,358
会い続ける坂道で潮騒燃えた日
On the continuous slope, the day the sound of waves burned brightly,

57
00:08:48,858 --> 00:08:56,558
止まらない未来を目指して譲れない願いを抱きしめて
Aiming for an unstoppable future, embracing an unwavering wish,

58
00:08:58,858 --> 00:09:04,758
閉ざした瞳をひらかせてきたけれどもっと大きな優しさがみえた
Opening my closed eyes, a much greater kindness was visible.

59
00:09:09,508 --> 00:09:14,208
優しさがみえた
Kindness was visible...

60
00:09:19,008 --> 00:09:26,558
止まらない未来を目指して譲れない願いを抱きしめて
Aiming for an unstoppable future, embracing an unwavering wish,

61
00:09:32,858 --> 00:09:38,958
負けない気持ちでクリアしてきたけど
Clearing it with an unbeatable spirit, but...

62
00:09:40,058 --> 00:09:46,458
スタートラインに立つたびに怯えていた
Every time I stood at the starting line, I was frightened.

63
00:09:49,008 --> 00:09:55,858
止まらない未来を描いて腕を伸ばし
Drawing an unstoppable future, reaching out my arms,

64
00:09:58,008 --> 00:10:00,008
心を…
My heart...

65
00:10:00,426 --> 00:10:03,406
輝いて　止まらない
Shining, unstopping...

66
00:10:03,406 --> 00:10:10,286
未来を目指して　譲れない願いを抱きしめて
Aiming for the future, embracing an unyielding wish.

67
00:10:11,046 --> 00:10:17,426
色褪せない　心の地図　光にかざそう
Let's hold our unfading map of the heart up to the light!

68
00:10:18,526 --> 00:10:27,546
色褪せない　心の地図　光にかざそう
Let's hold our unfading map of the heart up to the light!

69
00:11:13,621 --> 00:11:16,541
他の誰かになんて　なれやしないよ
I could never become anyone else anyway.

70
00:11:16,881 --> 00:11:21,621
そんなの分かってるんだ
I already know that.

71
00:11:22,341 --> 00:11:29,681
明日は信じてみたいのさ　微かな自分を愛せなくたってさ
I want to believe in tomorrow, even if I can't love my faint self.

72
00:11:31,961 --> 00:11:46,941
Teenager Forever

73
00:11:47,441 --> 00:11:54,741
望んだこと全てが　叶うわけないよ　そんなの分かってるんだ
Not everything we hope for comes true; I already know that.

74
00:11:55,821 --> 00:12:03,501
深い傷もいつれは　草むらに換えて　剥がれ落ちるだろうか
Will deep wounds eventually turn into grassy fields and peel away?

75
00:12:03,941 --> 00:12:13,461
いつまでも変わらず　つまらない話も　つまらない仲に　どこまでも幸せを探すよ
Forever unchanging, sharing boring stories with boring friends, searching for happiness anywhere.

76
00:12:14,421 --> 00:12:21,901
サイクルも今は溢れてるのに　スタイルなんて分からなくて今でも言葉を探してるんだ
Even though cycles are overflowing now, I still don't know my style and am searching for words.

77
00:12:22,261 --> 00:12:29,901
遠くしていた夢の欠片に　僕のめくるめくあなたのきらめきに　気付けたらいいんだ
It would be great if I could notice the fragments of dreams I distanced myself from, and your dazzling brilliance.

78
00:12:31,581 --> 00:12:46,461
Teenager Forever

79
00:12:47,221 --> 00:12:54,881
結局この頃誰も　教えてくれないんだ　進むべき道なんて
In the end, no one teaches us nowadays which path we should take.

80
00:12:55,381 --> 00:13:02,881
今日を信じたままで　生きていくぜ　年を重ねても
Believing in today, I'm going to keep living, even as I grow older.

81
00:13:04,281 --> 00:13:11,881
いつまでも変わらず　つまらない話も　つまらない仲に　どこまでも幸せを探すよ
Forever unchanging, sharing boring stories with boring friends, searching for happiness anywhere.

82
00:13:13,641 --> 00:13:19,521
きらめきを探してよ　散々見回して振り回されて
Search for that brilliance, looking around wildly, being pushed and pulled around.

83
00:13:20,181 --> 00:13:24,821
大切なのはあなただってことに気付けないままで
Without realizing that what's precious is you.

84
00:13:25,081 --> 00:13:31,381
一体未来はどうなるのかなんてことより　僕らの今をきらめきに気付けたらいいんだ
Rather than wondering what the future holds, it would be great if we could notice the brilliance in our present.

85
00:13:32,481 --> 00:13:48,921
Teenager Forever

86
00:13:49,661 --> 00:13:57,221
他の誰かになんて　なれやしないよ　そんなの分かってるんだ
I could never become anyone else anyway, I already know that.

87
00:13:58,321 --> 00:14:06,241
明日は信じてみたいのさ　微かな自分を愛せなくたってさ
I want to believe in tomorrow, even if I can't love my faint self.

88
00:14:11,021 --> 00:14:22,056
Teenager Forever

89
00:14:44,261 --> 00:14:53,541
突然降る夕立　ああ傘もないや　空のご機嫌なんかしらない
A sudden evening shower, ah, I don't even have an umbrella. Who cares about the sky's mood?

90
00:14:54,741 --> 00:14:59,941
季節の変わり目の服は何着りゃいいんだろう
What clothes should I even wear for the change of seasons?

91
00:15:00,321 --> 00:15:03,521
季節の変わり目の服は何着りゃいいんだろ春と秋どこいっちゃったんだよ
What am I supposed to wear for the change of seasons? Spring and autumn, where did they even go?

92
00:15:04,351 --> 00:15:08,981
息も出来ない 情報の圧力 めまいの螺旋
I can't even breathe, the pressure of information, a spiral of dizziness...

93
00:15:09,181 --> 00:15:13,631
わたしはどこにいる
Where in the world am I?

94
00:15:14,291 --> 00:15:24,151
こんなに こんなに 息の音がするのに 変えだね 世界の 音が しない
Even though I can hear my breathing so clearly, how strange... the sound of the world doesn't exist.

95
00:15:24,911 --> 00:15:33,791
足りない 足りない 誰にも気づかれない 殴り書きみたいな音 出せない状態で叫んだよ
Not enough, not enough, nobody notices. Sounding like scribbles, I screamed in a state where I couldn't make a sound.

96
00:15:34,291 --> 00:15:43,191
ありのまま なんて 誰に見せんだ バカなわたしは歌うだけ
Who am I even showing my true self to? I'm just a fool singing away.

97
00:15:44,271 --> 00:15:47,851
ぶちまけちゃおうか 星に
Shall I spill it all out to the stars?

98
00:15:58,811 --> 00:16:08,451
エリクサに張り替える作業もなんとなくなんだか 欠けた爪を少し触る
Even the task of restringing my elixir feels somewhat pointless... I touch my chipped fingernail a little.

99
00:16:09,031 --> 00:16:18,731
半径300mmの体で必死に鳴いてる 音楽にとっちゃ ココが地球だぜ
Crying out desperately in a body with a radius of 300mm, to music, right here is the Earth!

100
00:16:19,531 --> 00:16:23,831
空気を握って 空を殴るよ
Grasping the air, punching the sky...

101
00:16:24,031 --> 00:16:29,051
なんにも起きない わたしは無力さ
Nothing happens, I am so powerless...

102
00:16:29,151 --> 00:16:38,931
だけどさ その手で この鉄を弾いたら 何かが変わって 見えたような
But if you pluck this steel with that hand, something seemed to change.

103
00:16:39,231 --> 00:16:48,871
眩しい 眩しい そんなに光るなよ わたしのダサい影が より色濃くなってしまうだろ
Dazzling, dazzling, don't shine so brightly! My uncool shadow will only become even darker, won't it?

104
00:16:49,271 --> 00:16:58,851
なんでこんな熱くなっちゃってんだよ 止まない 馬鹿なわたしは歌うだけ
Why am I getting so worked up? It won't stop, I'm just a fool singing away!

105
00:16:59,271 --> 00:17:01,451
うるさいんだって 心臓
My heart is being so noisy!

106
00:17:12,011 --> 00:17:21,911
青い惑星 ひとりぼっち いっぱいの音を聞いてきた 周り続けて
Blue planet, all alone, I've listened to so many sounds, keeping on spinning...

107
00:17:22,111 --> 00:17:31,971
幾億年 瞬きでもいいから 奇跡を... 聞かせて
For hundreds of millions of years, even if it's just for a blink... let me hear a miracle!

108
00:17:32,371 --> 00:17:43,851
聞いて 聞けよ 私 私はここにいる 殴り書きみたいな音 出せない状態で叫んだよ
Hear me, listen! I am right here! Sounding like scribbles, I screamed in a state where I couldn't make a sound.

109
00:17:44,091 --> 00:17:53,111
何者になりたい 何者かだっていい 馬鹿なわたしは歌うだけ
Wanting to become someone, anyone is fine—I'm just a fool singing away.

110
00:17:53,531 --> 00:17:57,411
ぶちまけちゃおうか 星に
Shall I spill it all out to the stars?

111
00:18:49,871 --> 00:18:54,291
とおいとおい むかしばなし
A far, far away tale of old...

112
00:18:54,991 --> 00:18:59,091
それはきっと あすのはなし
That is surely a story for tomorrow.

113
00:19:06,871 --> 00:19:10,611
もう 飛べやしないさ
I can no longer fly...

114
00:19:10,911 --> 00:19:20,671
墜ち続ける夜から醒めた 白い部屋の片隅で
Waking up from a never-ending falling night, in the corner of a white room.

115
00:19:21,251 --> 00:19:26,531
彷徨ってる 自由をなくして
Wandering about, having lost my freedom...

116
00:19:26,851 --> 00:19:32,471
塞ぐ 倒れ込んだまま
Blocking my ears, lying collapsed.

117
00:19:33,371 --> 00:19:38,011
ああ 細い片翼が あああいないんだ
Ah, my slender single wing... Ah, it's gone.

118
00:19:38,231 --> 00:19:43,731
叫んだ 心が止まらなくて
I cried out, my heart wouldn't stop racing.

119
00:19:44,251 --> 00:19:54,871
機械みたいにきしむ僕を 現実が笑った その時 誰かがささやいたんだ
Reality laughed at me as I creaked like a machine. At that moment, someone whispered to me:

120
00:19:55,391 --> 00:19:59,971
「あなたにあげた つばさ」
[Quote: "The wings I gave you"]

121
00:20:00,496 --> 00:20:03,536
あなたに あげた つばさ
...The wings I gave to you

122
00:20:01,206 --> 00:20:03,966
わたしの ゆめみた せかい
were the world of my dreams.

123
00:20:05,186 --> 00:20:07,206
星を見失った
I lost sight of the stars.

124
00:20:12,186 --> 00:20:16,886
鳴響く風が
The howling wind...

125
00:20:17,936 --> 00:20:22,286
止まないで 高く 高くへ
Won't stop, blowing higher and higher...

126
00:20:23,086 --> 00:20:28,186
幾度夢見が 祈った雲の果て
To the edge of the clouds where I prayed through countless dreams.

127
00:20:29,486 --> 00:20:33,886
終わりを越えて 高く 高くへ
Crossing beyond the end, higher and higher...

128
00:20:34,136 --> 00:20:41,586
かけがえのない ガラクタの羽で
With these irreplaceable wings of scrap.

129
00:20:46,086 --> 00:20:48,586
星を見失った
I lost sight of the stars.

130
00:20:49,286 --> 00:20:53,386
紛れ住む 人間のセカイ
In this human world where I wander and live,

131
